[Network]
# Private network of the monitoring stack: Grafana reaches TimescaleDB as `timescaledb:5432` here, and changedetection's collector
# (apps/changedetection/changedetection-otelcol.container) pushes to `victoriametrics:8428`. Nothing is published except
# TimescaleDB, Grafana and VictoriaMetrics on the mesh address (see the .container files).
